      "reason": "GHSA-fc5q-39xc-vjpf covers every released picomatch and no patched release exists, so there is nothing to upgrade or override to. Every dependent listed is build, bundler, test or lint tooling that matches file paths against patterns this repository supplies. The owner approved the waiver on 2026-11-18; remove it and the manifest entry when a patched release ships.",
      "owner": "Platform lead",
